WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.905
Animals need habitats

2
00:00:01.905 --> 00:00:31.746
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Animals need habitats. Habitat woh jagah hai jahan animal ko food, water aur shelter milta hai. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:31.746 --> 00:01:02.857
Pond frog ko paani ke paas food aur safe jagah milti hai. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
00:01:02.857 --> 00:01:39.683
Ek animal choose karo aur uske habitat ke food, water, shelter ko labelled picture mein dikhao. Apne observation ko ek sentence mein likho. Har number ya label ke saath sahi unit ya naam lagao. Sawaal solve karte waqt jaldi mat karo; clue ko underline karo, apna tareeka chuno, aur aakhir mein jawab ko example ke saath compare karo.

5
00:01:39.683 --> 00:02:56.508
Ab practice karo: Habitat animal ko kya deta hai? Thoda rukkar socho. Sahi jawab hai Food, water and shelter. Baaki options kyun fit nahi hote, yeh bhi apne shabdon mein batao. Habitat woh jagah hai jahan animal ko food, water aur shelter milta hai. Pond frog ko paani ke paas food aur safe jagah milti hai. Is idea ko yaad rakhne ke liye apni notebook mein ek chhota labelled drawing banao. Jab tum apne shabdon mein samjha paate ho, tab tumne sirf answer nahi yaad kiya, balki uska reason bhi samjha. Aaj ka chhota recap: Habitat woh jagah hai jahan animal ko food, water aur shelter milta hai. Agli baar aas-paas ki duniya mein isi idea ka ek aur example dhoondhna.

6
